{"id":969064,"slug":"takov-modern-rodinka-s-rie-3-2011","title":"Taková moderní rodinka- Série 3","title_en":null,"year":2011,"rating":86,"votes_count":535,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"série","vod_date":null,"plot":"Cameron a Mitchell uvažují o dalším dítěti a Jay s Glorií pomáhají stále pozitivnímu Mannymu s jeho vztahovými starostmi.(Netflix)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/162/652/162652184_4quics.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Komedie","Romantický"],"tags":[],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Jason Winer","Michael Spiller","Chris Koch","Scott Ellis","Fred Savage","Gail Mancuso","Steven Levitan","Bryan Cranston","James R. Bagdonas"],"actors":["Ed O'Neill","Sofía Vergara","Julie Bowen","Ty Burrell","Jesse Tyler Ferguson","Eric Stonestreet","Rico Rodriguez","Nolan Gould","Sarah Hyland","Ariel Winter","Aubrey Anderson-Emmons","Reid Ewing","Tim Blake Nelson","Annie Tedesco","Amanda Musso","Benjamin Bratt","Justin Kirk","Lusia Strus","Andres Londono","pes Brigitte","David Cross","Bob Levitan","Samm Levine","Nathan Blaiwes","Gilles Marini","Kevin Daniels","Andrea Savage","Artemis Pebdani","Jordan Nichols","Cory Knauf","Michael Eric Reid","Josh Gad","Ron Roggé","Eric Petersen","Philip Baker Hall","Don Lake","Micaela Johnson","Greg Kinnear","Phil Hendrie","Carolyn Morse","Cole Bernstein","Ernie Hudson","Will Greenberg","Kali Rocha","John DiMaggio","Frank Maharajh","Rodney J. Hobbs","Dave Bean","Ellen Barkin","Bobby Cannavale","Stephanie Faracy","Melinda Page Hamilton","Frank Wood","John Vickery","Alyssa Preston","Barry Corbin","Stacey Travis","Malcolm Foster Smith","Kevin Hart","Eric Edelstein","Matt Prokop","Sarah Baker","Beth Grant","Matt Roth","Angela Oh","Laird Macintosh","Marcos Mateo Ochoa","Christina Ochoa","Jack Laufer","Leslie Mann","Chazz Palminteri","Jennifer Tilly","Craig Zimmerman","Jessica Makinson","Zoe Jarman","Julian Works","Coleman Lannum","Danny Zuker","Gwen McGee","Margaret Welsh","Nancy Linari","Edward Finlay","Jonathan Emerson","Trisha Paytas","Jaret Martino","Chip Sickler","Jonathan Kehoe","Matt Lowe","Michael D. Cohen","Asif Ali","Claudia Choi","Terri Hoyos","Robin Krieger","Chris Dollard","Gary Kraus","Michael Yurchak","Matthew Gumley","Josh Latzer","Dash Dobrofsky"],"screenwriters":["Ben Karlin","Cindy Chupack","Steven Levitan","Abraham Higginbotham","Danny Zuker","Bill Wrubel","Jeffrey Richman","Elaine Ko","Dan O'Shannon","Paul Corrigan","Brad Walsh"],"cinematographers":["James R. Bagdonas","Brandon Mastrippolito"],"composers":["Gabriel Mann"],"reviews":[{"author":"M.i.k.e","text":"Sice o trošku slabší než předchozí série, ale i tak sem se smál dost a regulérně si tuhle osobitou rodinku zamiloval. I ve slabších chvílích je to stále lepší než jakýkoliv pokus o sitcom ze současnosti…80%(21.12.2024)","stars":4},{"author":"ScarPoul","text":"Ustálilo sa to na takom znesiteľnom štandarde. Potešia šteky Kevina Harta, Bobbyho Cannavaleho alebo Tim Blake Nelsona. Dokonca posledný diel v ktorom je ukázané, že v Mexiku je život naozaj telenovela ma dosť rozosmial. Nenútené, s veľmi jemným vtipom a dobre fungujúcimi postavami. Moderný Krok za krokom bez toho cringe feelingu. A všetky postavy sú v zásade sympatické. 3. séria - 80%(27.02.2023)","stars":4},{"author":"Necrotongue","text":"Podle mého výsledného hodnocení to tak sice nevypadá, ale třetí sezóna pro mě byla zklamáním. V mnoha epizodách se z děje vytratila dosavadní lehkost, scénář byl často těžkopádný, mnohdy mi chyběl i kvalitní humor, který se v obou předchozích řadách tak dařil, a až několik dílů v závěrečné čtvrtině mě přesvědčilo o tom, abych se sledováním nepřestával.(21.02.2019)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-943f5577-caad-4e34-a8d3-4a9a816d078a"},{"platform":"prima+","url":"https://www.iprima.cz/serialy/takova-m